[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0010","text":"──碰头时间变短了，真的很抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0020","text":"不会……\n您公务繁忙……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0030","text":"您辛苦了……\n制作人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0040","text":"嗯，凛世也辛苦了\n好好休息吧……晚安"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0042","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0050","text":"如果……能有更多……\n更多的时间……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0060","text":"──必须……练习才行……\n新的……朗读剧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0070","text":"『有什么想商量的事，随时联系我\n　凛世的话，一定能做出精彩的朗读剧的』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0080","text":"『谢谢您。』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0090","text":"万花筒……不断地……\n旋转……摇曳……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_03_0100","text":"然后……\n将光……联结……"}]
